ected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-09T20:35:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T20:35:51+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162697574,"discussion_id":"17bcb502f7b8d89da5b33751232c3322429d8d31","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-09T20:35:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T20:35:53+08:00","user":{"id":"68848bfb2fa6cc24b2557cb7","login":"BoyangZhang","object_id":"68848bfb2fa6cc24b2557cb7","name":"BoyangZhang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/BoyangZhang"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162697625,"discussion_id":"84d74b970697cba5376296c5936e1f208855e742","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复 `aclnnCdist` 算子中关于 `compute_mode` 参数校验逻辑与文档说明不一致的错误。当参数 `p` 为 2.0 时，代码的校验逻辑错误地将允许的 `compute_mode` 值设为 0，而文档说明为 2，导致用户遵循文档调用时会产生参数校验失败，影响算子正常使用。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n将 `aclnnCdist` 算子中，当参数 `p` 等于 2.0 时，对 `compute_mode` 参数的允许值从 `0` 更正为 `2`。此修改同步更新了算子接口的文档说明和底层 C++ 实现中的校验逻辑，确保了代码行为与文档的一致性，消除了因参数设置不符而导致的调用失败风险。","created_at":"2026-02-09T20:36:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T20:36:08+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162697723,"discussion_id":"ff6a9d624b31b298eac6520c1856fe9a279b43d7","body":"流水线任务触发成功 [<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=baa35b32363740f6b9f960db67777bd8&pipelineRunId=3b45def8ea384667835f739f8d4b